{"id":"vorwurf","lemma":"Vorwurf","pos":"noun","rank":3393,"glosses":["reproach","accusation"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːʁˌvʊʁf/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-Vorwurf.ogg/De-Vorwurf.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Vorwurfes","plural":"Vorwürfe"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kann ihm keinen Vorwurf machen.","en":"I can't blame him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393103","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Sie konnten ihre Vorwürfe nicht beweisen.","en":"They could not prove their charges.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to prove"}]},{"text":"Mach ihr das nicht zum Vorwurf.","en":"Don't blame it on her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755853","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ich mache Ihnen deswegen keine Vorwürfe.","en":"I don't blame you for doing that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"therefore"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Ich mache dir dafür keinen Vorwurf.","en":"I don't blame you for this.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"for that, for it"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]}]}